#: scenario3:scenario3_FD388E09_8B10_4CDF_8E5C_1549B97DC055
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 03cf44eb5f263d6f8d21b3de543221f41d704de5e5aa5ab775e0e13a71549324
#. default-sha256: c21bb7869b70acfecb5578e6aeeaecc393e03e735a678a7513f9c988acfd3bb5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FD388E09_8B10_4CDF_8E5C_1549B97DC055"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The Pacific Railroad’s “Last Spike” ceremony was drawing nearer by "
"the day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫A cerimônia do “Último Espigão” da Ferrovia do Pacífico estava se "
"aproximando a cada dia."

#: scenario3:scenario3_10FBEF3D_2159_4CF1_B0E0_3CE07EF4BF2E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d63738f9be79491be4241d6a78c43ccdb2ff1bb1f318633f3ed2c9a78e68a8f
#. default-sha256: 51a5b816bc140db9264159eb3b9519cdd13168c225ecaf5ff87d2f92cc247d05
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_10FBEF3D_2159_4CF1_B0E0_3CE07EF4BF2E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That day was, coincidentally, the deadline the two of them had set for themselves—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"Jacopo to confront his wife, and the White-Haired Girl to wait for him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Esse dia era, coincidentemente, o prazo que os dois estabeleceram para si mesmos—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"Jacopo para confrontar sua esposa, e a Garota de Cabelos Brancos para esperar por ele."

#: scenario3:scenario3_49D5AE19_E4BA_4311_A29D_1D4FFF10B3ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 05cbb11a365ac2658e0568ab0ec339382a6bd76b134d7ab85e78739aaffa2b6c
#. default-sha256: 6a197722cd225e2bab38708ed1dae0e33df774ff57635beff6f67a0b382cac92
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_49D5AE19_E4BA_4311_A29D_1D4FFF10B3ED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And as that day approached, she continued to write letters."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E à medida que esse dia se aproximava, ela continuou a escrever cartas."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7236BB12_217D_4031_A3C7_DCFE8DEE849F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 41cc6a3d6c99de7a92717d0ba57cccd09609ba7036f73c483c9e99066e6c5e87
#. default-sha256: 712cb180d91f082b09eb60c3824af5b45aee04d79017c4e229c6cf99fda45321
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7236BB12_217D_4031_A3C7_DCFE8DEE849F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She wrote the letters purely by force of habit,⟪k:1⟫despite having been worn visibly thin."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela escreveu as cartas puramente por força do hábito,⟪k:1⟫apesar de visivelmente não ter o "
"mesmo ânimo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FBE7FD54_B9BA_41B4_9C1F_473C3A1FC584
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5954cc077d15e101b997be85c00c4c2f6d2245ce14a1aaac9bb9180ca32e9e43
#. default-sha256: 6b75cfa371637fa2c6d6e2d842e9272aab6895d7a96df4ebdc3423cf0ddfef1d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FBE7FD54_B9BA_41B4_9C1F_473C3A1FC584"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I expect that she could not stop—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫that the act of writing was all that kept her "
"from going mad."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Acho que ela não podia parar—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫que o ato de escrever foi tudo que a impediu de "
"enlouquecer."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DDEF16C4_2820_4312_A143_35094965C838
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20f3c144a1504a4355df2b2fcfc1c17bd684fda045ef62c84948176c48ea6c2a
#. default-sha256: 0c812ae8e8665c7d57b2d3feef36c93eb0d59ee88923f7d883fb70690bda3e54
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DDEF16C4_2820_4312_A143_35094965C838"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫By focusing her attention on another person through her letters, she was able to maintain "
"her grip on herself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ao focar sua atenção em outra pessoa por meio das cartas, ela conseguiu manter o controle "
"sobre si mesma."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4CCA9C38_1121_4241_B109_6722D3A9183F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61fda565d08ce7d56575be97181666d1e6cd3fc143f0fa1c66ac93d8888e7707
#. default-sha256: e44c1599989aa082a83b9576e8b6b92eb4f9023096e3b5088e0600017fd67ef8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4CCA9C38_1121_4241_B109_6722D3A9183F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that day would put an end to her suffering and despair.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫When the railroad was "
"completed, all their misunderstandings would be cleared up."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas aquele dia poria fim ao seu sofrimento e desespero. ⟪k:1⟫Quando a ferrovia estivesse "
"concluída, todos os mal-entendidos seriam esclarecidos."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9FA08EFD_A6FB_4CC2_A94F_14E38A5A6665
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da505a63411dded1f3412d93a047a63f0b5f840a993e3b374583c8dc6dc9d960
#. default-sha256: e0f8bd75e3e1ebfee8c8fb813e8787c5c3961d80840adad00015738a28d20b2c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9FA08EFD_A6FB_4CC2_A94F_14E38A5A6665"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They would return to the smiling, happy couple they had been when they were first married."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eles voltariam ao casal sorridente e feliz que tinham sido quando se casaram."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D47C7A99_4FBB_4EC8_B49A_C33745E2AA47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb509942e90020278c6538b781d4040a4855a037ca6192fd263183644c70b367
#. default-sha256: 14e5b912afcba5cd067f70450b58c4457959a38b9b0fde1e1f02944c5a8ac16d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D47C7A99_4FBB_4EC8_B49A_C33745E2AA47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The harsh winter would finally come to a close, melting away into the past and allowing them "
"to step into the future."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O inverno rigoroso finalmente chegaria ao fim, derretendo-se no passado e permitindo-lhes "
"entrar no futuro."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9A818C79_BCA8_46DB_8D77_99A0AB587962
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c92d5da3e064a65fc1980143d230df289b3b0a25dcca4a0f46ab0b2716773949
#. default-sha256: fbf141af8979d945f528891cc41ca428bbb4b68c94d43d2bdd4633d0a10e186e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9A818C79_BCA8_46DB_8D77_99A0AB587962"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With constant prayer in my heart, I impatiently awaited the railroad’s opening ceremony."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Com orações constantes em meu coração, esperei impacientemente a cerimônia de abertura da "
"ferrovia."

#: scenario3:scenario3_69CAAA81_630D_42F6_8BE1_2427A5D15C72
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83a83c63473812a3b71edf5df107607eff9ad6aedefcf74a84905950b20b0bfc
#. default-sha256: 8593ad47d16785901f074d14a256cce42b61f6bc7398be771d3c6c0be28533db
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_69CAAA81_630D_42F6_8BE1_2427A5D15C72"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I do not, after all, wish for anyone to fall into any kind of misfortune..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Afinal, não desejo que ninguém caia em nenhum tipo de infortúnio..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7C82EAD2_E1F7_4235_A164_E19C0AD1C3ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07e9716b45d1afa1aac15465312644ada5e248512e7b79880925941263ee964e
#. default-sha256: 12571ec2ccb3f0d63439177fea6c3adb1f5e2463e2b38932187977969cb441a1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7C82EAD2_E1F7_4235_A164_E19C0AD1C3ED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And that goes for you as well, Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E isso vale para você também, Mestre."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0B419369_3A6E_416B_8CD3_7BF4E12CB384
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 00d8ff90b7ea7b9eb57370bb94b1bfa15ea2dac8ae44a3cb2090003683f4f664
#. default-sha256: 4efc47e464a7823a4930b23e54e4956b454e0f1243384bcbdca4762708c3301e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0B419369_3A6E_416B_8CD3_7BF4E12CB384"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Now, Master... ⟪k:1⟫The door is soon to be shut upon this era."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Agora, Mestre... ⟪k:1⟫A porta logo será fechada para esta era."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A5EBDE59_069C_4707_A7D6_63C1CCC2AA45
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 121cfb31bce0c8affa8e5a5444868fe2b888f294228cd1f50ee76f58267f0f98
#. default-sha256: 5fc297a1af8e02603a418afb4ac047c4df862b4415afabc36794fb93d6fc4ac8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A5EBDE59_069C_4707_A7D6_63C1CCC2AA45"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Are you prepared to see what happens next?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I see. Very well."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Está preparado para ver o que acontece a seguir?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu entendo. Muito bem."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D5AC5A40_6B95_41CC_81F9_2E678752541F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4e60dc72b7879a617d402920c6b79764c46e13c568aa177a4616ddd63c5a05c
#. default-sha256: 0b7b32f3d2fa69849f827d109d064272180013eead3dd53d6759eb05fa4c0c30
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D5AC5A40_6B95_41CC_81F9_2E678752541F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Then allow us to make our way to that final day.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫See with your own eyes, Master, "
"how this tale concludes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Então permita-nos seguir nosso caminho para esse dia final.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Veja com seus próprios "
"olhos, Mestre, como esta história termina."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5CA27902_7BE1_4C88_B5E6_E3257157761D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d71b78abb60e99bc7b68fdabcad8dce7a8632c7a19784124a61ac382e7e88b18
#. default-sha256: e604a4e247a74961b5cf68165b576559fd3bceefa925eaa7bed1491f3688acf7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5CA27902_7BE1_4C88_B5E6_E3257157761D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And please... ⟪k:1⟫do not let go of my hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E por favor... ⟪k:1⟫não solte minha mão."

#: scenario3:scenario3_38183C3A_5A49_49E9_9078_137F657FA40A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0297a4d1107a097abdd060cb916544a518bc90b11478857581ffdbde51dd51bd
#. default-sha256: 4658fa56634218cd50ab80a2f9c9ea92209076e6579836508eab2ac5ddafabce
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_38183C3A_5A49_49E9_9078_137F657FA40A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫.................."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫.................."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D4A6FA98_A7C3_4324_8BC0_7853D9A17202
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e94a267ec3776da3dd1d112f99dbbae22364dc05ebcacb4d97b0f35878505b93
#. default-sha256: b644c8f7d43a5d94bda626982d25743aa4f1fe10efae3e5229b60c6e0fbf79d4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D4A6FA98_A7C3_4324_8BC0_7853D9A17202"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The night before the opening ceremony, the master of the house headed for his wife’s shed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Na noite anterior à cerimônia de abertura, o dono da casa dirigiu-se ao galpão de sua esposa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_00629B75_CB74_4C66_AEB9_43218111BC59
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b0530a864267e6f4ce23a3238a5c56869fabc66e1c1bbf419759dc71e1332a52
#. default-sha256: 0775bbd74cc1299d2a24115d6a12d37ab891a24b98d088e70280dfee5599c7a9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_00629B75_CB74_4C66_AEB9_43218111BC59"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was a tension on his face, but a surety in his step.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He had found the resolve "
"to speak with her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Havia tensão em seu rosto, mas segurança em seus passos.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ele tinha encontrado a "
"determinação para falar com ela."

#: scenario3:scenario3_07151B49_FE0E_49DD_BCB1_6B1E509795E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4594c7b54ff101c809886bae5a86c3a53d4c9dabf257ae67a7c76ff9f81e640e
#. default-sha256: c35f719b03e388d1e52434ce710c58e5ad6611f7a74841620b130a7d5a492237
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_07151B49_FE0E_49DD_BCB1_6B1E509795E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Having locked her away for so long in the shed like a common prisoner, Jacopo was hardly "
"optimistic about what she might say to him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Depois de trancá-la por tanto tempo no galpão como uma prisioneira qualquer, Jacopo não "
"estava muito otimista sobre o que ela poderia dizer a ele."

#: scenario3:scenario3_74DF934A_2B1D_4AC2_A228_28F59D2EFD3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9f87f3f6bc043c36dcb83cab9650ab76f582f1ffbb91401ed7868ebc507134c
#. default-sha256: 6efe6fc5f396be68b82416cacd42f0af9e5db3ad3eef04a6c5a2ca69a70be5b8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74DF934A_2B1D_4AC2_A228_28F59D2EFD3E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had undeniably mistreated her, said heartless and cruel things to her, and even gotten "
"physically violent with her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele inegavelmente a maltratou, disse coisas cruéis e sem coração, e até foi fisicamente "
"violento com ela."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8AB2F328_F485_4FC7_83A6_FC5D21CE79D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e31cee860148f0a28393255cb9500e978e8ab3c06c033696908f12204ec211a5
#. default-sha256: d6e67b54a94c294838a0d0e7115e1e2e17e4003cb0c4a2cfe8e6f71d128da5cb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8AB2F328_F485_4FC7_83A6_FC5D21CE79D4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫His actions were inexcusable, even if they were in response to her infidelity."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Suas ações eram imperdoáveis, mesmo que fossem em resposta à infidelidade dela."

#: scenario3:scenario3_647B08CC_5594_438B_BA30_D4E9D0929645
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2ccd76685f04dc303b8dbb2f84b39609fb4d40708c0d538e29b5fb9776c29af
#. default-sha256: 0846821670d2443fd2d1350c529692ed2c26f22b6864129bf9a4206598ce080f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_647B08CC_5594_438B_BA30_D4E9D0929645"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Of course, the very infidelity which had driven him to such behavior had not, in fact, taken "
"place, but he was unaware of that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫É claro que a própria infidelidade que o havia levado a tal comportamento não havia, de "
"fato, ocorrido, mas ele não sabia disso."

#: scenario3:scenario3_385304CF_5B4C_49D0_90A2_B0F045A80595
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df84470c903f79a64ef958b64b532883c66942b864cff82624123099232fa85a
#. default-sha256: fe4c8c4f4ca5401af16901f2557185fb93245b2e817e6e31be4a805561b6bb4f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_385304CF_5B4C_49D0_90A2_B0F045A80595"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was a chance they would never reconcile their misunderstandings, and that this "
"predicament would not have a positive resolution, but he still clung to a tiny fragment of hope."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Havia uma chance de que eles nunca reconciliassem seus mal-entendidos, e que essa situação "
"não tivesse uma resolução positiva, mas ele ainda se agarrava a um pequeno fragmento de esperança."

#: scenario3:scenario3_23DE3C47_FF4D_4DD6_A52E_50ED583D252A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 399f4628bc1c0471c299a613844e29eaf0ec9e7d8017f729b28aeb6e55cba0ac
#. default-sha256: a6f85990dcaaf71dbb8501b86d6a27486cfd33f68bdb93887643d66ae6572d87
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_23DE3C47_FF4D_4DD6_A52E_50ED583D252A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He wanted to start over with the White-Haired Girl, to make a new future with her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele queria recomeçar com a Garota de Cabelos Brancos, construir um novo futuro com ela."

#: scenario3:scenario3_53EE63C7_F841_468E_ACF2_685521941970
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87e0b1604b17c78e50f95252f4795203f43c8131dfaaad65f66044e32c8b12c1
#. default-sha256: 2d3048679a2ed82615cb0a2180382c5cbbdbb86787a134f50e6d4b234f937017
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_53EE63C7_F841_468E_ACF2_685521941970"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With that desire burning strong in his heart, he stood before the door to her shed and "
"called out to her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Com aquele desejo queimando forte em seu coração, ele parou diante da porta de seu galpão e "
"a chamou."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4B0BB762_4B96_4477_B69D_442908B2BD4E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 04139f49fd17c963de4cc78566f86ce4077154176325efd8e6872e642c006fc8
#. default-sha256: 7ece9fba71fc3b39d63e13706cdcdb3fd80f91cdbbd0c50c486bc3e186460781
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4B0BB762_4B96_4477_B69D_442908B2BD4E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Are you awake?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It’s me, Jacopo.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫May I come in?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Você está acordada? ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Sou eu, Jacopo. ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Posso entrar?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5AAE587A_3589_4AB5_8902_3829339585B7
