msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Fine, then you don’t have to let me in.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫But please at least hear me out."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Tudo bem, então você não precisa me deixar entrar. ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Mas, por favor, pelo menos "
"me ouça."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0DCD6C30_1AA6_4355_A4E7_5D88B49F514A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9effd53dc7c956eb2c1d5c869c3435c96e4e36d16f26ab2e0f58eb71625cdcee
