msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0DCD6C30_1AA6_4355_A4E7_5D88B49F514A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Do you remember the day, shortly after we first met, when we went on our honeymoon—⟪k:1⟫"
"⟪k:2⟫if you can even call the little walk we took a “honeymoon”?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Você se lembra do dia, pouco depois de nos conhecermos, quando fomos em nossa lua de mel—"
"⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫se você pode chamar a pequena caminhada que fizemos de “lua de mel”?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_6EB8BE68_C493_4B2F_9754_C84D02B1D6D3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57e9a71cceee1225bccfbe259aa887b1092621565db7bc72c0891ea19e07a07d
