msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I didn’t know what I should do for you.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And yes, I know, that makes me sound "
"juvenile."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu não sabia o que deveria fazer para você. ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫E sim, eu sei, isso me faz parecer "
"juvenil."

#: scenario3:scenario3_10513E68_864E_4D8F_8860_24EA263673B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 73a66f65a2d3c6fc9ade0f1509ab0959e7fcfc5cf60e3cb713252a02155106cd
