msgid "⟪k:0⟫I have a tendency to say things I don’t mean the more perturbed I get."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tenho a tendência de dizer coisas que não quero quanto mais perturbado fico."

#: scenario3:scenario3_33015A72_A7C7_49DD_B551_92F3AD4DB0CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13720b107c3c611c842d17bdee5ce7c160a906d60408e81e64cd6c31eeed51b8
