msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m sure I said things to hurt you numerous times that day."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Estou certo de que disse coisas para machucá-la várias vezes naquele dia."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9A9004BD_F57D_415B_A8B7_1CF5D92D76B9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8ec61b3db1b22ae8c1bf5804622a44697d93a3917166c9e5bf25f514ccb9e19
