"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫However, at the photography shop, when you saw the phenakistoscope, you smiled for me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No entanto, na loja de fotografia, quando viu o fenaquistoscópio, você sorriu para mim."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2464D230_600A_4746_8E3B_401DF78C5987
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8d7863ebbd0727a19e0dfb8520e6c0f9611a4250fcf7868e34566e96abbf90e
