msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu estava... ⟪k:1⟫eu estava genuinamente satisfeito naquele momento."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9A10FC2F_5A65_43FC_B4D6_EA158DC04EBF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3086d29d509053bcd5c9a7a21c2c43db51986f03e3e6ef6c9fbdd247c3ea4da7
