msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I very much doubt that was actually an appropriate present for a noblewoman like "
"yourself."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Duvido muito que fosse realmente um presente apropriado para uma nobre como você."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AE64D2D4_72C3_4570_9C9B_CC092ECBF7B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 567f24577dee21f86bf1f98131f6a37db962e4f0892e6dba72e9889cc245235c
