msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Jewels or flowers or something like that—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫something beautiful—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫would "
"have certainly suited you better."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Jóias ou flores ou algo assim—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫algo bonito—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫certamente seria mais "
"adequado para você."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C29791DF_946F_4063_95CC_BFE677E70E4E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1adf975d1552473ccc6f547358b2f66e51e7ad84941d6f2c5c5bd875a6013656
#. default-sha256: 3cf5eeb0db23c756f9cb698693bf56e04a5a763eaf4a3257faef9b6c1182cb4c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C29791DF_946F_4063_95CC_BFE677E70E4E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And I knew that, but I assumed you would have been given gifts like that countless times in "
"the past."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E eu sabia disso, mas presumi que você teria recebido presentes como esses inúmeras vezes no "
"passado."

#: scenario3:scenario3_25D7D30A_890E_450B_9D32_3D08EBA4B641
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 877cccce6d64e38822e07f9c65f01eed86e2358f3840d74af4eb7da69d10b611
#. default-sha256: 96b3376139136ad381c57115bf70e80f17d8f012add597d199106ba770a36343
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_25D7D30A_890E_450B_9D32_3D08EBA4B641"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You are, after all, a beautiful woman.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I did not want to have to compete on the "
"same field as those other men."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Você é, afinal, uma mulher bonita. ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu não queria ter que competir no mesmo campo "
"que esses outros homens."

#: scenario3:scenario3_1A65C782_4D12_46A1_903B_44A8BBECBA68
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 684529c27e1a0f7e3d30aa4e124bc82cc6ebc44713a80b02014ad28845ba224d
#. default-sha256: 9fdbc62d61b95f588fc06018a30a4645fcb81d04acdbf9a15e4282407ba6cd18
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1A65C782_4D12_46A1_903B_44A8BBECBA68"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wanted to be special—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫No, I wanted to be ⟪k:4⟫unique⟪k:5⟫ to you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu queria ser especial—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Não, eu queria ser ⟪k:4⟫único⟪k:5⟫ para você."

#: scenario3:scenario3_10147F57_FE9E_489C_864D_4AD1C79148B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c81ea28bdba12f3f16c7c10d05d0d7b15586f0f3643f36b7f5a4a21aceb642d
#. default-sha256: 16d918ec73b97171e34d487f27059524e69371c346a148200c55aafaf1c06474
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_10147F57_FE9E_489C_864D_4AD1C79148B6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No one had ever shown you anything of the sort before, had they?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ninguém nunca lhe mostrou nada do tipo antes, não é?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_24CDFCC3_5F65_48B3_A6B8_FC96CA179226
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d785575e1bf9939c014b001f157f56a40fcaaa78eccb1c5883dac33236a56c5d
#. default-sha256: 4a51a2c004ae38ba48b2268e6cd253cfb1af291ad11765e7989221a67d8d0fe1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_24CDFCC3_5F65_48B3_A6B8_FC96CA179226"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Frankly, I wasn’t sure if a woman of your status would take any interest in a "
"phenakistoscope at all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Francamente, eu não tinha certeza se uma mulher do seu status teria algum interesse em um "
"fenaquistoscópio."

#: scenario3:scenario3_34376F6A_E076_4BBE_8B79_457847B89390
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 99ec19207a8e9361b4e75e8f21d8256f2e4c01c73496a3842dfd0aeb9fe689f4
#. default-sha256: 44d8b76528659ea6ef1c55461952d4258c645db68b7fa25494f32a24008275e3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_34376F6A_E076_4BBE_8B79_457847B89390"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagine you’ve thrown it out by now,⟪k:1⟫but I choose to believe you sincerely liked it on "
"that day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Imagino que você já tenha jogado fora a uma altura dessas,⟪k:1⟫mas eu escolho acreditar que "
"você sinceramente gostou naquele dia."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C51409A2_B8A6_403A_8B97_16CC37DF799A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a12a3cc3ab80c462e349f421ac812c65de9e8ae442d007f2270fabca239b96b
#. default-sha256: 507be7633ff6dfd5bb8de75671ae5cb18fb92e952c921ca496b55d51cd0cb998
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C51409A2_B8A6_403A_8B97_16CC37DF799A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That... ⟪k:2⟫if just for a moment... ⟪k:3⟫I caught your eye.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Even if you "
"started seeing other men afterwards,⟪k:6⟫that moment was real, wasn’t it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Que... ⟪k:2⟫mesmo que por um momento... ⟪k:3⟫eu chamei sua atenção. ⟪k:4⟫Mesmo que você "
"tenha começado a ver outros homens depois, aquele momento foi real, não foi?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F6BB0F89_5D8D_4091_8F2A_70C4461515A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf34e21dc584c44045cd72c702447fc989fffe49853765220393b1b7d47608dc
