"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Several maids were roused from their slumber by the racket, but no one had the "
"courage to speak up as the master of the house frantically charged through the halls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Várias criadas foram despertadas de seu sono pela algazarra, mas ninguém teve "
"coragem de protestar enquanto o dono da casa investia freneticamente pelos corredores."

