msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was certain he had closed the door before leaving, but now a sliver of light shone "
"through the gap between it and the frame. ⟪k:1⟫From within the room, he thought he could sense "
"someone’s presence."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele tinha certeza de que tinha fechado a porta antes de sair, mas agora uma tira de luz "
"brilhava através do vão entre ela e o batente. ⟪k:1⟫ De dentro da sala, ele pensou que podia "
"sentir a presença de alguém."

